nal rolling stage. [Data: Entities (1542, 1499, 1478, 1543, 1549); Relationships (3171, 3172, 3178, 3097, 3039, +more)]\\n\\nThese relationships indicate that the scheme controls both the pass sequence and the thermal history before the last rolling stage. [Data: Entities (1542, 1543, 1549); Relationships (3171, 3172, 3178)]\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"summary\": \"Implementation on Mill 3600\",\n      \"explanation\": \"Mill 3600 is the rolling mill on which the schemes may be implemented. The 1ST SCHEME КП+УО+КП may be implemented on mill 3600, and realization on Mill 3600 is explicitly tied to the mill. [Data: Entities (1503, 1556, 1427); Relationships (3132, 3185)]\\n\\nThis links the process scheme to a specific industrial asset, making Mill 3600 a key enabling entity for practical deployment. [Data: Entities (1503, 1427); Relationships (3132, 3185)]\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"summary\": \"Testing and practical implementation\",\n      \"explanation\": \"The first scheme is recommended for testing and practical implementation. This recommendation is directly associated with the 1ST SCHEME КП+УО+КП. [Data: Entities (1555, 1427); Relationships (3184)]\\n\\nThe community therefore includes not only process definitions but also an implementation pathway, suggesting that the scheme is intended for evaluation and industrial adoption. [Data: Entities (1555, 1427); Relationships (3184)]\"\n    }\n  ]\n}"}, "metrics": {"attempted_request_count": 1, "successful_response_count": 0, "failed_response_count": 0, "responses_with_tokens": 1, "prompt_tokens": 4363, "completion_tokens": 6114, "total_tokens": 10477, "compute_duration_seconds": 28.894010543823242, "streaming_responses": 0, "retries": 0, "requests_with_retries": 0}}}